    "detailed_description": "A relaxed and lightweight roguelite tower defense game unfolding on a conveyor belt sushi restaurant!\ud83c\udf63\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd16<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Flow:</h2>The game consists of a repetition of the Card Purchase Phase and the Sushi Wave Phase. Players need to effectively pick up weapons, towers, and cards to gain power against the sushi waves.<br><br><strong>Card Purchase/Effect Activation Phase</strong><br>Purchase cards to increase your stats. Cards activate their effects at the start of each round.<br>The variety of cards available increases with Sushi Tier, allowing more cards to be activated at once.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/9b87a70d23e58fa3fad01a4009bfacab.poster.avif?t=1750559628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/9b87a70d23e58fa3fad01a4009bfacab.webm?t=1750559628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/9b87a70d23e58fa3fad01a4009bfacab.mp4?t=1750559628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><strong>Sushi Wave Phase</strong><br>By defeating sushi and accumulating experience points, you can raise your Sushi Tier.<br>If you can't handle enemy attacks and your HP drops to zero, it's game over. After defeating a certain number of enemies, you enter the purchase phase.<br>Ultimately, if you can survive until the set time, you clear the game.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/47527a8a6dba53a5bafeb6b0baba6f06.poster.avif?t=1750559628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/47527a8a6dba53a5bafeb6b0baba6f06.webm?t=1750559628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/47527a8a6dba53a5bafeb6b0baba6f06.mp4?t=1750559628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of &quot;sushininjarobot TD&quot;:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unpredictable Progression: </strong>With different card combinations each time, there are countless ways to win!<br></li><li><strong>Simple Gameplay: </strong>Operate your ninja robot and quickly deal with the flowing sushi. If you keep missing them, it's game over!<br></li><li><strong>Easy to Enjoy:</strong> Perfect for a short break!<br></li><li><strong>Unique Hand-Drawn Graphics: </strong>Graphics made during a short break!<br></li><li><strong>Unnecessarily Long Opening:</strong> A unique opening specific to this game!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What &quot;sushininjarobot TD&quot; does not offer:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiplayer<br></li><li>Elaborate puzzle-like level design</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video/Streaming Guidelines</h2>You are free to create monetized videos and streams without permission, regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.",
    "about_the_game": "A relaxed and lightweight roguelite tower defense game unfolding on a conveyor belt sushi restaurant!\ud83c\udf63\ud83e\udd77\ud83e\udd16<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Flow:</h2>The game consists of a repetition of the Card Purchase Phase and the Sushi Wave Phase. Players need to effectively pick up weapons, towers, and cards to gain power against the sushi waves.<br><br><strong>Card Purchase/Effect Activation Phase</strong><br>Purchase cards to increase your stats. Cards activate their effects at the start of each round.<br>The variety of cards available increases with Sushi Tier, allowing more cards to be activated at once.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/9b87a70d23e58fa3fad01a4009bfacab.poster.avif?t=1750559628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/9b87a70d23e58fa3fad01a4009bfacab.webm?t=1750559628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/9b87a70d23e58fa3fad01a4009bfacab.mp4?t=1750559628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><br><strong>Sushi Wave Phase</strong><br>By defeating sushi and accumulating experience points, you can raise your Sushi Tier.<br>If you can't handle enemy attacks and your HP drops to zero, it's game over. After defeating a certain number of enemies, you enter the purchase phase.<br>Ultimately, if you can survive until the set time, you clear the game.<br><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/47527a8a6dba53a5bafeb6b0baba6f06.poster.avif?t=1750559628\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/47527a8a6dba53a5bafeb6b0baba6f06.webm?t=1750559628\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3019000/extras/47527a8a6dba53a5bafeb6b0baba6f06.mp4?t=1750559628\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features of &quot;sushininjarobot TD&quot;:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Unpredictable Progression: </strong>With different card combinations each time, there are countless ways to win!<br></li><li><strong>Simple Gameplay: </strong>Operate your ninja robot and quickly deal with the flowing sushi. If you keep missing them, it's game over!<br></li><li><strong>Easy to Enjoy:</strong> Perfect for a short break!<br></li><li><strong>Unique Hand-Drawn Graphics: </strong>Graphics made during a short break!<br></li><li><strong>Unnecessarily Long Opening:</strong> A unique opening specific to this game!</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What &quot;sushininjarobot TD&quot; does not offer:</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Multiplayer<br></li><li>Elaborate puzzle-like level design</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Video/Streaming Guidelines</h2>You are free to create monetized videos and streams without permission, regardless of whether you are an individual or a corporation.",
